<title>UK: NIB sets 2.0 billion rand zero-coupon bond.</title>
<headline>NIB sets 2.0 billion rand zero-coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDIC INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN RAND  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    09.JUL.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  2.8575    PAY DATE    09.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	LISTING    LONDON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.125     PRAECIPUUM  0.1</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
